--- a/AYUGRAM_IOS_0.7.1.md	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
+++ b/AYUGRAM_IOS_0.7.1.md	2026-09-30 19:43:54.000000000 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# AyuGram iOS Port 0.7.1
+
+This tree is a best-effort port of selected AyuGram Desktop 7.0.9 features onto Telegram-iOS.
+
+## Included in 0.7.1
+- Ghost Mode core and TelegramCore gating for read receipts, story views, online presence, and upload progress.
+- Pre-delete/pre-edit capture with bounded Postbox-backed AyuGram history.
+- Native AyuGram settings and scoped History screen.
+- Regex filter engine persisted per account, applied before chat history entries are rendered, plus message-context quick-add.
+- AyuGram History entry from a single-message context menu.
+
+## Not an IPA
+Xcode/macOS/iOS SDK signing is required to produce an installable IPA. This environment cannot run Xcode, so this package has not been claimed as a compiled iOS application.
+
+## Important porting notes
+- This is not a byte-for-byte conversion of the Desktop Qt implementation. iOS UI and platform behavior are reimplemented using Telegram-iOS architecture.
+- Desktop-only features such as tray/window handling, updater, and plugin loading are intentionally not copied as-is.
+- Full Xcode compilation still needs to be performed on a Mac with the required Telegram-iOS dependencies, API credentials, and signing setup.
