@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@
+# AyuGram iOS Port — progress
+
+## 0.1
+Portable AyuGram Swift core: settings, Ghost Mode policy, message history, regex filters and Message Shot models.
+
+## 0.2
+Initial TelegramCore hooks for message deletion/edit capture.
+
+## 0.3
+TelegramCore Ghost Mode hooks for read state, stories, presence, upload progress and message views.
+
+## 0.4
+Expanded Ghost Mode integration and verified clean patch application.
+
+## 0.5
+Added native TelegramUI AyuGram settings/history screens and wired an AyuGram entry into the settings list.
+
+## 0.6
+Moved deleted/edit history persistence into the account Postbox preferences state and changed the History screen to read from Postbox.
+
+## 0.7
+Added persisted regex filters, chat-render filtering, quick-add from message context, and per-dialog history navigation.
+
+## 0.8
+Added typed history filtering, duplicate suppression, history mode selectors, scoped clear-deleted action, and first Message Shot clipboard action.
+
+## 1.1.0
+Added media-aware Message Shot rendering, display-only Zalgo/bidi sanitization, customizable edited mark, translation-provider selector, and completed Build target dependencies for the new rendering hooks.
